+# 2026-09-30 — Profile lifecycle follow-up (RUN-02)
+
+W000 integration source 2b26c383 is under Unity CI 36708562947. Fast Preflight passed.
+Before expanding persistence to more worlds, investigate first-hour profile replacement.
+
+Source evidence: FirstHourDirector constructs its core only in Awake; HomeHubRuntime replaces the
+profile in New Game and Continue. OnNewGameProfile merely accepts a signal into that old core.
+The outbound-travel latch is process memory and is not reconstructed from completed tutorial beats.
+Observation tracking also remains active when the current beat becomes null. These are lifecycle
+risks with concrete source mechanisms; device impact still needs verification.
+
+Bounded next edit, after W000 verification: rebuild the director's pure core from the current profile
+on reference replacement; reset hint/observation/scene subscriptions; restore outbound evidence from
+completed contract beats; preserve only the actually observed boot-presentation signal when New Game
+replaces its pre-choice profile. Add behavioral lifecycle regression cases. No profile schema,
+travel ownership, inventory, rig or input changes are needed.
+
+Other cached systems (RILL flag history/queued lines and W001 payoff latch) remain a separate audit;
+this bounded director repair will not close RUN-02 globally.
